<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Lübeck Guide: 11 places – Holstentor, courtyards, St Mary’s &amp; marzipan – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Holstentor</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Take the photo from the other side, then walk across the bridge and through the gate. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>10.67968,53.86627,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Niederegger – Marzipan</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come early or on a weekday, in Advent it is very crowded. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>10.68577,53.86655,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. St Mary’s Church (Marienkirche)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Take the lift up – the view over the roofs is worth it. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>10.6851,53.86777,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Town hall on the market square</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Take a tour if you have time – the interior is impressive. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>10.68546,53.86713,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. European Hansemuseum</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Plan it for a rainy day. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>10.68953,53.8739,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Buddenbrook House &amp; literature</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Combine the Buddenbrook House and Grass House in one walk. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>10.68579,53.86835,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Schiffergesellschaft – the house of 1535</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Reserve at weekends and try a regional dish. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>10.68809,53.87117,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Salt storehouses &amp; the Trave waterfront</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Go at sunset, then the brick glows. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>10.6802,53.86586,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Holy Spirit Hospital</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · In Advent you come for the Christmas market, otherwise for the quiet. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>10.68991,53.87138,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Travemünde – Baltic beach</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Go in spring or autumn and eat a fish roll on the promenade. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/luebeck/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>10.87596,53.96487,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
